ake it as reference. We are still working hard to increase this to 60FPS in future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notice:</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any of the following bugs in-game, simply save and reload to restore normal play. Because they’re extremely hard for us to reproduce, the team is still working to track them down and fix them:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Valenbair Boss room lantern disappears.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Any bugs, issues? welcome to contact us by email:<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><a href=\"mailto:hddy2000@qq.com\">hddy2000@qq.com</a></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We promise we spare no effort to solve it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About AI Usage:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some In-Game audio and 3D modeling are generated by AI.</p>",
